  "bodyHash": "0ea64d8b29022759",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>NiftyCarts</strong></span><br>是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikorcarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">AstikorCarts</a> 模組的 Fabric 移植版。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>連結</strong></span><br>- 本專案：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fniftycarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://github.com/jmb05/nifty-carts\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 Github</a><br>- AstikorCarts (Forge 1.12.2, 1.16.4/5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2)：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikorcarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 CurseForge</a><br>- AstikorCarts Redux (Forge 1.19.4-1.20.1)：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fastikorcarts-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikor-carts-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">於 CurseForge</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>礦車</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模組新增三種不同的礦車：</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>補給車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/6893627cf0b30eaa37e3f5e1752e40f8bd7b6a46.gif\" alt=\"補給車 GIF\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>- 擁有相當於雙層儲物箱的物品欄空間<br>- 後方設有一個座位</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>犁地車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/e56a6022ae274cb7bb713ad157032e9031c16fc5.gif\" alt=\"犁地車 GIF\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\"></p>\n<p>- 有放置 3 種工具的空間（鋤頭、鏟子、斧頭）<br>- 會使用這些工具處理下方方塊（翻土、生成道路、剝離樹皮）</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動物載具</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/5bd43402b8842303d1c65493b2af3f290c8c7009.gif\" alt=\"動物載具 GIF\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>- 為騎乘生物上的兩名玩家提供兩個座位</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span></p>\n<p>按下「動作鍵」快捷鍵（預設為 'R'），即可將附近的礦車附著或脫離你正在騎乘的實體。 <br>按一下疾跑按鈕可切換「慢速模式」。你的騎乘生物與礦車移動速度將會變慢。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>模組展示影片（由 Zeddy Minecraft 製作）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suTj01lAFOk\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>輪子</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/e93733ad927acfe08e23fa02432930ad4bc89a1f.png\" alt=\"輪子合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>補給車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/23560032e7e8db0017c2e7f590d96f623ed009ce.png\" alt=\"補給車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>犁地車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/a3586b5eb22a4a8819bf8ed50f20a91eb9448d04.png\" alt=\"犁地車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動物載具</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/de8ca4369830fe55dba0cfc28d11227fbec5781c.png\" alt=\"動物載具合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>手推車</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/1fe51705ccc0a4b8d8cc46a251f692745bddfc9d.webp\" alt=\"手推車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>",
